## Felsöknings- och fixrapport: EventPulse Duplicate Events

---

### 1. ROOT CAUSE (Exakt varför duplicering sker)

**Primär orsak:** 
- `loadEvents()` funktionen i `App.js` (rad 395) appendade ny data till state utan deduplicering: `setEvents(prev => [...prev, ...data])`
- Vid scroll ("load more") hämtades samma data om och om igen och lades till i befintlig lista

**Sekundär orsak:**
- `handleLoadMore()` triggade pagination även när `selectedProvider` (t.ex. "stockholm") var aktiv
- Ingen `isFetchingRef` för att förhindra parallella fetches
- Instabila `keyExtractor` i SectionList orsakade oönskad om-rendering

---

### 2. BERÖRDA FILER

| Fil | Ändring |
|-----|---------|
| `/workspace/App.js` | Huvudfix - deduplicering, fetch-skydd, keyExtractor |

---

### 3. KODÄNDRINGAR

**A) Nytt dedup-funktion (rad 14-34):**
```javascript
function deduplicateEvents(events) {
  const seen = new Map();
  for (const event of events) {
    const stableKey = event.id 
      ? `id:${event.id}`
      : `src:${event.source || 'unknown'}:ttl:${event.title || ''}:tm:${event.start_time || event.date || ''}`;
    if (!seen.has(stableKey)) {
      seen.set(stableKey, event);
    }
  }
  return Array.from(seen.values());
}
```

**B) Nytt isFetchingRef för att förhindra dubbla fetches:**
```javascript
const isFetchingRef = useRef(false);

const loadEvents = useCallback(async (pageNum = 0, isLoadMore = false) => {
  if (isFetchingRef.current) return;  // <-- Nytt
  isFetchingRef.current = true;
  // ... fetch logic ...
  isFetchingRef.current = false;  // <-- I finally
}, []);
```

**C) Deduplicering vid state-uppdatering:**
```javascript
if (isLoadMore) {
  setEvents(prev => {
    const combined = [...prev, ...uniqueData];
    return deduplicateEvents(combined);  // <-- Dedup vid append
  });
} else {
  setEvents(uniqueData);  // <-- Dedup vid initial load
}
```

**D) handleLoadMore blockerar pagination vid filter:**
```javascript
if (!loadingMore && !loading && !timeFilter && 
    selectedCategories.length === 0 && !selectedProvider) {
  loadEvents(page + 1, true);  // <-- Nu blockeras detta vid stockholm-filter
}
```

**E) Stabil keyExtractor:**
```javascript
keyExtractor={(item, index) => {
  if (item.isGrouped) {
    return `grouped-${item.title}-${item.date}`;
  }
  return item.id ? `event-${item.id}` : `event-${item.source || 'unknown'}-${item.title}-${item.date || ''}`;
}}
```

---

### 4. TEST

**Verifiering:**
1. Öppna appen och välj "Stockholm" som arrangör
2. Scrolla neråt - events ska INTE dupliceras
3. Testa med andra filter (tid, kategori) - ska fungera identiskt
4. Byt mellan arrangörer - inga konstigheter

**Kodtest (automatiserat):**
```javascript
// Testa deduplicateEvents()
const events = [
  { id: '1', title: 'Konsert', source: 'stockholm' },
  { id: '1', title: 'Konsert', source: 'stockholm' }, // duplicate
  { id: '2', title: 'Teater', source: 'stockholm' },
];
const result = deduplicateEvents(events);
console.assert(result.length === 2, 'Should have 2 unique events');
```

---

### 5. GIT COMMIT

**Branch:** `fix/stockholm-duplicate-events`

**Commit:**
```
fix: prevent event duplication when scrolling with stockholm filter

Root cause:
- loadEvents appended new data to state without deduplication
- handleLoadMore triggered on scroll even when provider filter was active
- No stable keys used in SectionList for React list reconciliation

Changes:
- Added deduplicateEvents() function using stable keys (id or title+start_time)
- Added isFetchingRef to prevent concurrent fetches
- Updated handleLoadMore to block pagination when ANY filter is active
- Improved keyExtractor to use stable event.id or composite keys
- Fixed GroupedEventItem keys for consistent list rendering

This ensures:
- Each event appears exactly once in the list
- No duplicate fetches on scroll
- Stable React list rendering with proper key reconciliation
- Works correctly with all filters (stockholm, time, category)
```

---

### 6. SAMMANFATTNING

| Aspekt | Före | Efter |
|--------|------|-------|
| Deduplicering | ❌ Ingen | ✅ Stabil nyckel-baserad |
| Fetch-skydd | ❌ Möjligt med dubbla | ✅ `isFetchingRef` |
| Pagination | ❌ Triggar vid filter | ✅ Blockerad vid filter |
| React Keys | ❌ Index-baserad | ✅ Id-baserad |

**Branch:** `fix/stockholm-duplicate-events` (1 commit framåt från main)

